asset:        sentry.min.js
title:        Sentry browser SDK 11.11.0 (error reporting only), bundled for the web app
author:       Functional Software, Inc. dba Sentry
source:       https://www.npmjs.com/package/@sentry/browser (version 11.11.0)
license:      MIT
license-file: NOTICE (Sentry section)
added:        2026-11-23 by Claude (agent) for the Cutroom project
notes:        Generated, not hand-written. Rebuild: npm install @sentry/browser@11.11.0 esbuild@0.28.2; an entry file
              that does `import { init, captureException, captureMessage, setTag } from '@sentry/browser';
              window.Sentry = { init, captureException, captureMessage, setTag };`; then
              `esbuild entry.js --bundle --minify --format=iife --target=es2020 --legal-comments=eof`.
